  data: {
    LLM: "Core rules same as Swazi Casino: Captured cards kept face up in pile. Top card can be used by opponents in augmented builds. Must play exactly one card per turn. Can perform multiple build actions. Single builds (sum=value) and augmented builds (multiple sets with same value). Build owner must eventually capture. Drifting (using capturable card in build) allowed. Cannot capture directly from opponent's pile.",
    Player: "Core rules same as Swazi Casino: Captured cards kept face up in pile. Top card can be used by opponents in augmented builds. Must play exactly one card per turn. Can perform multiple build actions. Single builds (sum=value) and augmented builds (multiple sets with same value). Build owner must eventually capture. Drifting (using capturable card in build) allowed. Cannot capture directly from opponent's pile.",
